<title>POLAND: SAB , POLISH PARTNERS TO INVEST $200 MLN.</title>
<headline>SAB , POLISH PARTNERS TO INVEST $200 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's largest brewery group, in which South African Breweries Ltd (SAB) has a strategic stake, plans to double its investment in Poland to about $400 million in five years, SAB group chairman Meyer Kahn said on Tuesday.</p>
